  Git editor save barrier
    ✔ waits for buffered operations before invoking Git and always restores editor access
    ✔ does not run Git if saving timed out or buffered edits remain

  Native graph history navigation
    ✔ dismisses a commit hover card when its history rows are replaced (68ms)
    ✔ offers provider links for the hovered commit and names multiple remotes (65ms)
